<p>
Am I so wise<br>
that I have nothing<br>
left to learn,<br>
or just afraid of<br>
what I might hear?
</p>

<p>
Though others cannot,<br>
the voice of God still speaks,<br>
warning that justice comes,<br>
both for me<br>
and for those<br>
I have silenced.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


